          <h2 id="themes-title">Pick a look. The whole app follows.</h2>
          <p>Thirteen light and dark themes ship with Sarala, or import your own. Choose one below to recolour this page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-gallery reveal" data-stagger>
          {THEMES.map((t) => (
